{"3783840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Knightwatch", "steam_appid": 3783840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the footsteps of the King's castle is his most loved winter town. You are one of the last line of defense - the Knight watch.<br>By day, you build walls, traps, place towers.<br>By night, you fight endless waves of monsters - undead, zombies, werewolves, wraiths, witches and other creatures of the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>KnightWatch</strong>, every sunrise is earned through blood and grit. Build smart, fight hard, and adapt with each passing night in this <strong>first-person tower defense roguelike</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build by Day</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct defenses, walls, traps, towers and upgrade those buildings. Every decision matters; what you build in the day determines if you'll survive the night.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend by Night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up and pick up your favorite weapon to fight off monsters of the night. Defend not just the town but also the towers you built during the day.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>unique blend</strong> of FPS combat, tower defense, and roguelike progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day–night gameplay loop</strong>: build, defend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple enemy types</strong>: zombies, werewolves, wraiths, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple</strong> <strong>weapons</strong>: swords, hammers, and crossbows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural waves and random upgrades</strong> for replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric PS2-inspired Pixel 3D art art style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the footsteps of the King's castle is his most loved winter town. You are one of the last line of defense - the Knight watch.<br>By day, you build walls, traps, place towers.<br>By night, you fight endless waves of monsters - undead, zombies, werewolves, wraiths, witches and other creatures of the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>KnightWatch</strong>, every sunrise is earned through blood and grit. Build smart, fight hard, and adapt with each passing night in this <strong>first-person tower defense roguelike</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build by Day</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct defenses, walls, traps, towers and upgrade those buildings. Every decision matters; what you build in the day determines if you'll survive the night.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend by Night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up and pick up your favorite weapon to fight off monsters of the night. Defend not just the town but also the towers you built during the day.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>unique blend</strong> of FPS combat, tower defense, and roguelike progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day–night gameplay loop</strong>: build, defend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple enemy types</strong>: zombies, werewolves, wraiths, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple</strong> <strong>weapons</strong>: swords, hammers, and crossbows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural waves and random upgrades</strong> for replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric PS2-inspired Pixel 3D art art style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "By DAY - Build defenses and towers. BY NIGHT - grab weapon of your choice and fight off relentless waves of zombies, undead, werewolves and other monsters. In a FPS x Tower Defense game where you defend a winter town overshadowed by the King’s castle.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Russian, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783840/1a279c1a561bc7130609475df00b56220548fe55/header.jpg?t=1771132016", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783840/db06629f483632b4f7dae73ca9df0f3ef0106199/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771132016", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783840/db06629f483632b4f7dae73ca9df0f3ef0106199/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771132016", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 1080 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> any<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> no</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 1080 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> any<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> no</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "This intellectual property and all trademarks and copyri